      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The database-only composition law assumes transaction closure preserves all required state, but `p` can change `PRAGMA foreign_keys`, which `Database` does not store, so a subsequent `q` querying that setting gives different results after restarting from `(db.run p).db`. Fix: preserve the foreign-key setting in connection-state composition and require its initial value to be restored for the database-only law."
